        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Al Pillay, Alan Pillay, Alana Pellay, Lana Pellay, Richardson, Adrian Edmondson, Keith Allen, Nigel Planer, Alexei Sayle, Ronald Allen, Robbie Coltrane\n- Products: The Supergrass, French and Saunders, The Vicar of Dibley, Eat the Rich, The Comic Strip Presents, Gino\n- Roles: Geraldine Granger, Mary\n\nFacts:\n- Dawn Roma French was born on 11 October 1957 and is an English actress, writer, and comedian.\n- Dawn French is best known for starring in and writing for the comedy sketch show \"French and Saunders\" with Jennifer Saunders.\n- Dawn French is also known for playing the lead role of Geraldine Granger in the sitcom \"The Vicar of Dibley\".\n- Alan \"Al\" Pillay was born on 22 August 1959.\n- Al Pillay was the star of \"Eat the Rich\".\n- In \"The Comic Strip Presents,\" Alan Pillay appeared as Alan Pellay playing himself in \"Gino\" episode 10.\n- In \"The Comic Strip Presents,\" Alan Pillay appeared as Alana Pellay playing herself in episode 13.\n- In the feature film \"The Supergrass,\" Alan Pillay appeared as Lana Pellay playing Mary.\n- The film \"The Supergrass\" starred Richardson, Adrian Edmondson, Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French, Keith Allen, Nigel Planer, Alexei Sayle, Ronald Allen, and Robbie Coltrane.",
